    <string name="tut_1_title">Play money, real feeling</string>
    <string name="tut_1_body">Moonbag is a game. Nothing here is real money and nothing needs the internet. Prices are simulated and keep moving even when the app is closed.</string>
    <string name="tut_2_title">Start with the moon</string>
    <string name="tut_2_body">You begin with $0. Open the Miner (the Earn button in your wallet) and tap the moon for your first dollars, then buy upgrades and mining farms that keep earning while you are away.</string>
    <string name="tut_3_title">Buy and sell</string>
    <string name="tut_3_body">Open a coin on the Market tab to see its chart and trade it. Every trade costs a 0.5% fee. Switch to candles and indicators to read the chart.</string>
    <string name="tut_4_title">Let the market come to you</string>
    <string name="tut_4_body">Set a limit buy, limit sell or stop-loss on any coin. Orders go off by themselves, even while the app is closed.</string>
    <string name="tut_5_title">Staking, NFT and events</string>
    <string name="tut_5_body">Lock coins in staking to earn more of them. Mint NFTs and sell them when the floor price rises. Bull runs, crashes and meme seasons shake the whole market.</string>
    <string name="tut_6_title">Launch your own coin</string>
    <string name="tut_6_body">Pay $2,000 to list a coin with a certificate and your own photo. Run marketing campaigns and burn coins, but remember that your own trades move its price.</string>
    <string name="tut_7_title">Climb the leaderboard</string>
    <string name="tut_7_body">Compare your net worth with invented traders. Open the rank card in Analytics (the chart icon in your wallet).</string>
